{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつき！\nわかつきと見せかけて橋本です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岩瀬ゆみこのブログを読んだ！\nゆみこ、バスケ好きらしい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみこ、バスケの試合\n一緒に観に行こうよーーー(*゜▽゜*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみこゆみこ〜〜\nゆみこぉ〜ゆみこぉ〜〜〜〜〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふ、ゆみこって呼ぶの好き笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょうどもうすぐ\nインハイも始まりますね！\n高校生の皆さん、頑張ってください(o^_^o)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、生donのブログも読んだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も丁度ダンスバージョンのPV観て\n「へ、私なんでこんなキョドってるの、やだ」\nって思ってたとこでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ、踏まれたやつか...(゜o゜)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこれ、向かって左の私たち側サイドは\n後ろ見ずに感覚で自分のポジションに\n入らなきゃいけないから\n踏む踏まれるは仕方ないことなんだよね(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もさゆりの足をたまに踏んでしまいます(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて言おう\n私こそごめん(;_;)(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0000-202.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は勉強してました。\nあ〜頭鈍ってるよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、有吉AKB共和国\n観て頂けましたか？(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"指原７さんとの対決でした☆\n私セクシーボイス出せない(;_;)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほい、ではお仕事行ってきます！"}],"source":"archive"}